.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt PQFREEBSD.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pqfreebsd.conf
.Nd POLICY, SUITE, dac.contexts, ledger.conf
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Emitted by the
.Nm pqfreebsd
skill after interview.
.Pp
.Pa POLICY
is
.Ql KEY=value
for groups, labels, ledger dataset, DAC mode, hash name.
.Pa dac.contexts
is first-match regex lines.
.Pa ledger.conf
names the dataset and forbids rewrite.
.Pp
Roles are
.Xr pw 8
groups bound to
.Xr login.conf 5
classes.
There is no group-to-label map in
.Xr login.conf 5
itself.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr login.conf 5 ,
.Xr pqfreebsd 8 ,
.Xr cap_mkdb 1
